#: ../../solutions.rst:91
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**9.1.** If the data commits before a separate receipt update, a crash "
#| "between them leaves the old receipt and a retry can apply the effect "
#| "again. If the receipt commits first, a crash before the data write can "
#| "cause the retry to skip data that never existed. One atomic "
#| "transaction removes both gaps. Losing the transaction's "
#| "acknowledgement still requires the retained retry."
msgid ""
"**11.1.** If the data commits before a separate receipt update, a crash "
"between them leaves the old receipt and a retry can apply the effect "
"again. If the receipt commits first, a crash before the data write can "
"cause the retry to skip data that never existed. One atomic transaction "
"removes both gaps. Losing the transaction's acknowledgement still "
"requires the retained retry."
msgstr ""
"**9.1.** "
"如果数据在单独的回执更新之前提交，两者之间的崩溃会留下旧的回执，重试可能再次施加该效果。如果回执先提交，在写入数据之前崩溃，可能导致重试跳过从未存在过的数据。一个原子事务可以消除这两个缺口。丢失事务的确认时，仍然需要保留的重试。"

